{"id":51,"bangumiId":51,"type":2,"name":"CLANNAD -クラナド-","name_cn":"CLANNAD","date":"2007-10-04","year":"2007","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/28/38/51_6PN42.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/28/38/51_6PN42.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/28/38/51_6PN42.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/28/38/51_6PN42.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/28/38/51_6PN42.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在一个小镇上，冈崎朋也是光坂高中在校生，因为家庭原因他一直过着浑浑噩噩的生活。他不参加任何社团活动，唯一的朋友是春原阳平。\r\n某天的上学途中，在樱花飞舞的坡道上，他邂逅了一名少女——古河渚，从此他的生活发生改变。渚因病休学一年，重返校园的她对周围环境感到相当不适应。她想加入戏剧部，然而戏剧部早已休部。朋也决定帮助她一起开展戏剧部的活动，二人关系变得越发亲密。随后不久朋也在图书馆中结识了一名天才少女一之濑琴美。","rating":{"rank":74,"total":28901,"count":{"1":106,"2":46,"3":56,"4":128,"5":435,"6":1350,"7":3887,"8":8722,"9":8232,"10":5939},"score":8.4},"collection":{"on_hold":2067,"dropped":465,"wish":9174,"collect":45840,"doing":3085},"tags":[{"name":"Clannad","count":7290,"total_count":21137},{"name":"京阿尼","count":7159,"total_count":217487},{"name":"key","count":6326,"total_count":47564},{"name":"催泪","count":5577,"total_count":61592},{"name":"治愈","count":3596,"total_count":309290},{"name":"団子大家族","count":3591,"total_count":3672},{"name":"神作","count":2812,"total_count":48407},{"name":"GAL改","count":2710,"total_count":79933},{"name":"人生","count":2235,"total_count":12104},{"name":"TV","count":1876,"total_count":1449967},{"name":"2007年10月","count":1725,"total_count":5705},{"name":"游戏改","count":1513,"total_count":166781},{"name":"校园","count":1267,"total_count":472549},{"name":"恋爱","count":1182,"total_count":585514},{"name":"2007","count":1171,"total_count":38401},{"name":"麻枝准","count":909,"total_count":23586},{"name":"京都","count":711,"total_count":7720},{"name":"石原立也","count":339,"total_count":16440},{"name":"京都动画","count":329,"total_count":33632},{"name":"日本","count":316,"total_count":316219},{"name":"日常","count":209,"total_count":417039},{"name":"海星","count":159,"total_count":166},{"